      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "chapter",
      "marker": "c",
      "number": "1",
      "sid": "3JN 1"
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "A Greeting from the Elder"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "r",
      "content": [
        "(",
        {
          "type": "ref",
          "loc": "2JN 1-3",
          "content": [
            "2 John 1:1–3"
          ]
        },
        ")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "1",
          "sid": "3JN 1:1"
        },
        "The elder,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        "To the beloved Gaius, whom I love in ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " truth:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "2",
          "sid": "3JN 1:2"
        },
        "Beloved, I pray that in every way you may prosper and enjoy good health, as your soul ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "also"
          ]
        },
        " prospers. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "3",
          "sid": "3JN 1:3"
        },
        "For I was overjoyed ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "when the"
          ]
        },
        " brothers came and testified about your devotion to the truth, in ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "which"
          ]
        },
        " you continue to walk. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "4",
          "sid": "3JN 1:4"
        },
        "I have no greater joy than to hear ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "that"
          ]
        },
        " my children are walking in the truth."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "Gaius Commended for Hospitality"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "5",
          "sid": "3JN 1:5"
        },
        "Beloved, you are faithful in what you are doing for the brothers, and ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "especially since"
          ]
        },
        " they are strangers ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "to you"
          ]
        },
        ". ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "6",
          "sid": "3JN 1:6"
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "They"
          ]
        },
        " have testified to ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " church about your love. You will do well to send them on their way in a manner worthy of God. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "7",
          "sid": "3JN 1:7"
        },
        "For they went out on behalf of the Name, accepting nothing from the Gentiles. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "8",
          "sid": "3JN 1:8"
        },
        "Therefore we ought to support such ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "men"
          ]
        },
        ", so that we may be fellow workers for the truth."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "Diotrephes and Demetrius"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "9",
          "sid": "3JN 1:9"
        },
        "I have written to the church ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "about this"
          ]
        },
        ",",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "1:9 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "Literally "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "I have written something to the church"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        " but Diotrephes, who loves to be first, will not accept our ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "instruction"
          ]
        },
        ". ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "10",
          "sid": "3JN 1:10"
        },
        "So if I come, I will call attention to ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "his"
          ]
        },
        " malicious slander ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "against"
          ]
        },
        " us. And unsatisfied with that, he refuses to welcome the brothers and forbids those who want to do so, even putting ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "them"
          ]
        },
        " out of the church."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "11",
          "sid": "3JN 1:11"
        },
        "Beloved, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "do"
          ]
        },
        " not imitate what ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "is"
          ]
        },
        " evil, but what ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "is"
          ]
        },
        " good. The ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "one who"
          ]
        },
        " does good is of God; the ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "one who"
          ]
        },
        " does evil has not seen God."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "12",
          "sid": "3JN 1:12"
        },
        "Demetrius has received a good testimony from everyone, and from the truth itself. We also testify ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "for him"
          ]
        },
        ", and you know that our testimony is true."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "Conclusion"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "r",
      "content": [
        "(",
        {
          "type": "ref",
          "loc": "2JN 12-13",
          "content": [
            "2 John 1:12–13"
          ]
        },
        ")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "13",
          "sid": "3JN 1:13"
        },
        "I have many things to write to you, but I would prefer not ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "to do so"
          ]
        },
        " with pen and ink. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "14",
          "sid": "3JN 1:14"
        },
        "Instead, I hope to see you soon and speak ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "with you"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "face"
          ]
        },
        " to ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "face"
          ]
        },
        ".",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "1:14 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "Literally "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "and we will speak mouth to mouth"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "; some translators begin a new verse (15) after "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "face to face."
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        "Peace to you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        "The friends ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "here "
          ]
        },
        " send you greetings."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        "Greet ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "each of our"
          ]
        },
        " friends ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "there"
          ]
        },
        " by name."
      ]
    }
  ]
}